#
# Names for NIRI gimbal mirror combinations
#
# List the most common name for a position first, followed by alternate
# names.
#

# name     nval    ster1    lowtol    hightol   ster2    lowtol    hightol

Neutral    2       Neutral  0         0    Neutral  0    0
Minimum    2       Minimum  0         0    Minimum  0    0
Maximum    2       Maximum  0         0    Maximum  0    0
MinMax     2       Minimum  0         0    Maximum  0    0
MaxMin     2       Maximum  0         0    Minimum  0    0
MinNeu     2       Minimum  0         0    Neutral  0    0
MaxNeu     2       Maximum  0         0    Neutral  0    0
NeuMin     2       Neutral  0         0    Minimum  0    0
NeuMax     2       Neutral  0         0    Maximum  0    0

# Don't touch these

pos00      2       pos00    0         0    pos00    0    0
pos01      2       pos01    0         0    pos01    0    0
pos02      2       pos02    0         0    pos02    0    0

datum      2       datum    0         0    datum    0    0
home       2       home     0         0    home     0    0

park       2       park     0         0    park     0    0

#
# For this mechanism, an INVALID position is not a problem.  Unfortunately,
# I can't list all possible combinations, because a lutin / lutout
# record only supports 30 entries.
#

Undefined  2       Undefined 0         0  Undefined 0    0
